    /// Federation directory: list goals matching `goals_filter_json`.
    ///
    /// `goals_filter_json` shape:
    /// `{"declared_by_key_id": str|null, "m1_dimension": str|null,
    ///   "scope_kind": str|null, "cohort_id": str|null,
