    // ── v1.5.19 (CIRISPersist#59 #11, FINAL) — wa_cert cluster ──
    //
    // 7 methods wrapping WaCertService. JSON wire format mirrors the
    // tasks / thoughts / ceremony / feedback patterns: WaCert struct
